        <terms:description xml:lang="en">The purpose of this vocabulary is to provide the definition of the structure of the commercial expenditure data cube. To this end, the W3C Data Cube vocabulary is reused, and the necessary instances have been created to define such structure, indicating the dimensions and measures used in this cube.  Additionally, several vocabularies and code lists are reused to describe the different breakdowns of commercial expenditure information, such as territory, reference period, economic activity sector, and nationality.</terms:description>
